WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:05.960
Hello, everyone. 'Welcome to Clínica por el Mundo', a website that is a health encyclopaedia

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:13.800
and aims to be as accessible and user-friendly as possible. We have various 

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:18.720
forms, such as the contact form and the search engine, which can be used to make different queries.

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:25.040
We can also return to the home page using the breadcrumb trail, but we will look at that later.

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:31.680
We also have a place to meet the creators, who are Alex Daniel Apolo and myself, 

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:37.720
Francisco José. As we said, thanks to the breadcrumb map, we can move around the site more easily.

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:43.640
A site map allows us to see a summary of all the options available and access them from here,

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:51.160
such as the home page, ‘About us’ or the search engine. Then we

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:57.280
have a series of features, such as Disease of the Day, where we can see a disease with an image, 

00:00:57.280 --> 00:01:04.480
symptoms, treatment and a related video. In addition to that, we have tables such as, for example,

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:11.400
a comparison of health insurance prices, with colours that comply with the appropriate standards.

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:18.680
There is also an alphabetical search engine, where you can enter the letter ‘A’, for example,

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:24.080
and although you can move on to the following letters, you can also access diseases

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:28.480
that begin with that letter, such as bronchitis under ‘B’,

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:32.840
where you will find a description, symptoms, treatment and related videos. If we go to Treatment, for example,

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:40.280
it allows us to access videos of the previously selected disease more quickly.

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:47.920
We also have videos on the home page with a health theme,

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:51.840
and we can access diseases of the human body just by clicking

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:59.720
on the button with the picture of the body. These are the functions of our website.

